<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ForenChain | Digital Thread of Justice</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #020617;
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8), rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8)), url('/public/images/homepage_background.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: white;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
        }

        .glass-nav {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            position: relative;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            bottom: -4px;
            left: 0;
            background-color: #3b82f6;
            /* Blue-500 color */
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid #1e293b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .partner-bar {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        @keyframes pulse-green {
            0% {
                opacity: 1;
            }

            50% {
                opacity: 0.5;
            }

            100% {
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background-color: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            animation: pulse-green 2s infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="w-full flex justify-end px-12 py-4">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-300">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            <span>Network Status: Secure / Blockchain Active</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <header class="w-full max-w-6xl px-6">
        <nav class="glass-nav flex justify-between items-center px-8 py-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-2xl font-bold">
                <span class="text-blue-500">§</span>
                <span>ForenChain</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-300">
                <a href="#" class="nav-link">Features</a>
                <a href="#" class="nav-link">SOP Standards</a>
                <a href="#" class="nav-link">About Us</a>
            </div>
            <a href="/login"
                class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white px-8 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold transition shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/20">
                Log In
            </a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4 mt-12">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight">
            Securing the <br> <span class="text-white">Digital Thread of Justice</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Blockchain-Based Chain of Custody Management <br>
            compliant with Forensic SOPs and PDRM Standards
        </p>

        <a href="/login"
            class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-400 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-lg text-xl font-bold transition-all transform hover:scale-105 shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/30 mb-16">
            Access Secure Portal
        </a>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 w-full max-w-6xl mb-16">
            <div class="feature-card p-8 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-blue-500/20 text-4xl"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i></div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Integrity</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Cryptographic proof for tamper-proof evidence for
                    evidence records.</p>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-mono italic">(Immutable Hashing)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card p-8 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-blue-500/20 text-4xl"><i class="fas fa-share-nodes"></i></div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Transparency</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Real-time distributed audit logs accessible to
                    authorized personnel.</p>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-mono italic">(Distributed Ledger)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card p-8 text-center relative overflow-hidden border-blue-500/50">
                <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-blue-500/20 text-4xl"><i class="fas fa-file-contract"></i></div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 border-b border-blue-500/30 pb-2">Compliance</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Adherence to Evidence Act 1950 & Digital Forensic
                    SOPs.</p>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-mono italic">(Malaysian SOPs)</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="w-full max-w-5xl mb-12">
            <h4 class="text-left text-gray-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 px-6">Trust Partners
            </h4>
            <div
                class="partner-bar flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center px-10 py-6 space-y-4 md:space-y-0">
                <div class="text-gray-500 text-[10px] text-left">
                    Developed for Peninsula College FYP 2026. <br>
                    Securely encrypted with SHA-256 protocols.
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-8 opacity-80">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Coat_of_arms_of_Malaysia.svg/1200px-Coat_of_arms_of_Malaysia.svg.png"
                            alt="Gov" class="h-8">
                        <div class="text-left leading-none">
                            <div class="text-[10px] font-bold">CyberSecurity</div>
                            <div class="text-[8px] uppercase">Malaysia</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 border-l border-white/10 pl-8">
                        <div class="text-right leading-none">
                            <div class="text-sm font-black tracking-tighter">PDRM</div>
                        </div>
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-halved text-2xl text-gray-400"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>

</html>